// Hood greets the player after the first battle.
@conversation hood_rematch

@page speaker=hood name="Hood" known=false portrait=neutral
Excuse me?

@page speaker=hood name="Hood" known=false portrait=disappointed
Another game?

@page speaker=hood name="Hood" known=false portrait=disappointed
I cannot refuse if you insist, but be warned. [portrait=annoyed]You may not survive.

@page speaker=hood name="Hood" known=false portrait=disappointed
Will you persist in troubling me?

@choice text="Yes" target=accept_challenge
@choice text="No" target=decline_challenge
